WEBVTT

00:06:29.542 --> 00:06:33.217
I would never be able to guess
better than chance,

00:06:33.241 --> 00:06:37.439
whether they were gay,
straight, bi or asexual

00:06:37.463 --> 00:06:39.607
in their affirmed gender.

00:06:39.631 --> 00:06:40.853
In other words,

00:06:40.877 --> 00:06:45.436
one thing has absolutely nothing
to do with the other.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:48.139
And the data show it.

00:06:50.075 --> 00:06:52.224
Now, as I took care of the 200 adults,

00:06:52.248 --> 00:06:53.843
I found it extremely painful.

00:06:54.814 --> 00:06:57.797
These people -- many of them --

00:06:57.821 --> 00:07:02.098
had to give up so much of their lives.